---
 drivers/hid/spi-hid/Kconfig      |  15 +++
 drivers/hid/spi-hid/Makefile     |   1 +
 drivers/hid/spi-hid/spi-hid-of.c | 242 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
